Subject: [PATCH] feat(modami): add be-modami-core-service, modami base path,
 Vault/Consul/ArgoCD

- Add k8s/apps/be-modami-core-service (Deployment + Service on 8080)
- Add k8s/modami/base for namespace modami (ingress, SA, PDB, secrets)
- Point modami-base Application to k8s/modami/base (avoid clash with techinsight k8s/base)
- ArgoCD Applications for modami auth, user, core; Image Updater for three images
- Consul: modami templates + extend load-config-into-consul.sh
- Vault: policies, setup-modami-policies-roles.sh, populate-modami-secrets.sh, README-MODAMI.md

